PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Intro::
    .string "Oh!\p"
    .string "You made it!\p"
    .string "Excellent.\p"
    .string "Sorry. I've been wondering when\n"
    .string "someone would get this far.\p"
    .string "I'm LANCE.\p"
    .string "And before you ask...\p"
    .string "yes, I know.\p"
    .string "I don't look much like the\n"
    .string "strongest member of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
    .string "People mention that surprisingly\n"
    .string "often.\p"
    .string "But Flying POKéMON are fascinating.\p"
    .string "Everyone thinks flying is just...\p"
    .string "well...\p"
    .string "going up.\p"
    .string "It isn't.\p"
    .string "Speed.\p"
    .string "Altitude.\p"
    .string "Turning radius.\p"
    .string "Approach angle.\p"
    .string "Wing structure.\p"
    .string "Even the ones that don't technically\n"
    .string "have wings--\p"
    .string "Ah.\p"
    .string "Sorry.\p"
    .string "I do that.\p"
    .string "Anyway!\p"
    .string "You've beaten everyone else.\p"
    .string "So now I get to see what your team\n"
    .string "can really do.\p"
    .string "Try to keep up!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
    .string "You're back!\p"
    .string "Excellent!\p"
    .string "I've actually been reviewing our\n"
    .string "last battle.\p"
    .string "Quite a lot.\p"
    .string "Possibly too much.\p"
    .string "I have notes.\p"
    .string "Diagrams.\p"
    .string "There may be a chart.\p"
    .string "But I promise I'm not going to\n"
    .string "explain all of it before we battle.\p"
    .string "Probably.\p"
    .string "Anyway!\p"
    .string "I learned from you.\p"
    .string "Now let's see whether you learned\n"
    .string "anything from me.\p"
    .string "Ready?{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Defeat::
    .string "...Oh.\p"
    .string "Oh, that was GOOD.\p"
    .string "Wait.\p"
    .string "Don't move.\p"
    .string "I need to remember this.\p"
    .string "You changed your approach halfway\n"
    .string "through the battle...\p"
    .string "and then when DRAGONITE--\p"
    .string "No.\p"
    .string "Never mind.\p"
    .string "I'll write it down later.\p"
    .string "You won.\p"
    .string "Fair and square.\p"
    .string "That doesn't happen very often.$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchDefeat::
    .string "Again?!\p"
    .string "Oh, that was fantastic.\p"
    .string "And completely different from last\n"
    .string "time.\p"
    .string "I need another notebook.$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "GREEN is through that door.\p"
    .string "She's the CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "And she's even stronger than I am.\p"
    .string "Which, statistically speaking...\p"
    .string "is probably not what you wanted to\n"
    .string "hear right now.\p"
    .string "Heh.\p"
    .string "Go on.\p"
    .string "You've earned the chance.\p"
    .string "And, uh...\p"
    .string "good luck.\p"
    .string "Seriously.$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchPostBattle::
    .string "GREEN is next.\p"
    .string "You know that already.\p"
    .string "Obviously.\p"
    .string "Sorry.\p"
    .string "Habit.\p"
    .string "Go on, CHAMPION.\p"
    .string "I want to see what happens.$"
